extends layoutPortfolio

block content

  section.hero(style="padding-bottom: 64px;")
    .wrap
      p.hero-kicker about
      h1(style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);") A few things worth knowing before you hire me

  section(style="padding-top: 0;")
    .wrap
      .about-grid
        .about-photo
        .about-copy
          p.
            I started programming by trying to automate a spreadsheet at a
            summer job, which turned into learning Python, then JavaScript,
            then far too much time spent debugging SQL queries at midnight.
            A few years on, that's still roughly what my days look like —
            just with better tools.
          p.
            I care most about the backend: how data is modeled, how a
            system behaves under real use, and how to keep an application
            simple enough that I can still explain it to someone else in
            five minutes. I'm currently deepening my Node.js and PostgreSQL
            work, and slowly getting comfortable with building things
            end-to-end rather than just the parts I already know well.
          p.
            I'm based in Vilnius, open to remote or hybrid work, and I like
            small teams where I can see the whole shape of what I'm
            building.

  section
    .wrap
      .section-head
        h2 What I work with

      .skills-list
        .skills-group
          h4 backend
          ul
            li Node.js / Express
            li PostgreSQL
            li REST API design
            li Python
        .skills-group
          h4 frontend
          ul
            li HTML / CSS
            li JavaScript
            li Pug templating
            li React (learning)
        .skills-group
          h4 tools
          ul
            li Git / GitHub
            li Docker (basics)
            li Linux
        .skills-group
          h4 currently learning
          ul
            li Authentication & sessions
            li Testing (Jest)
            li Deployment / CI
